Third-party software included in RcppHNSW

hnswlib
-------

RcppHNSW redistributes the header-only hnswlib library:

Project: hnswlib
Upstream source: https://github.com/nmslib/hnswlib
Version: v0.9.0
Tag commit: d9b3608c83d83b46c96e25088cb1d729b29dcfe9
Upstream authorship: Yury Malkov and other hnswlib contributors
Copyright: remains with the hnswlib authors and contributors
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
License text: LICENSES/hnswlib-LICENSE-2.0.txt

The pinned v0.9.0 source archive contains no NOTICE file.

Locally modified files
----------------------

Installed path: include/hnswalg.h
Source path: inst/include/hnswalg.h
Modification date: through 2026-09-06

RcppHNSW changes to that file:

* use hnswlib's checked external-label setter;
* route integrity-check output through RcppHNSW's configured error stream;
* synchronize the shared random-level generator used during construction;
* snapshot the entry point while hnswlib's global lock is held;
* validate serialized offsets and coordinate payload width when loading;
* report index-save open, write, flush, and close failures;
* preserve saved capacity when loading an empty index without an override;
* reject zero-capacity resize before reallocating storage; and
* carry a prominent notice identifying these downstream modifications.

Installed path: include/visited_list_pool.h
Source path: inst/include/visited_list_pool.h
Modification date: 2026-09-06

RcppHNSW changes to that file:

* hold each initial visited-list pool entry with temporary ownership until its
  container insertion succeeds, preventing a leak if allocation fails; and
* carry a prominent notice identifying the downstream modification.

The exact changes are the ordered patches under tools/vendor/patches in the
RcppHNSW source package. Package installation compiles the already-materialized
headers and does not download or patch hnswlib.
